{"id":"8cae575293a2fb87","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-sw-red.md","title":"常数附加使用的强弱真值表归约","display":"df-sw-red — 常数附加使用的强弱真值表归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-sw-red","aliases":["43-df-sw-red"],"display":"df-sw-red — 常数附加使用的强弱真值表归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Definition 13.5.2","source_printed_pages":"352","source_pdf_pages":"372","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_statement_checked":false,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-sw-red"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-sw-red</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sw-red — 常数附加使用的强弱真值表归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 13.5.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"352"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"372"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exec}\">\\(\\operatorname{Exec}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a> 的首次停机运行谓词。位编号从0起；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,c\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(x,c\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，有限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+c\">\\(x+c\\)</span> 表示查询位置集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;x+c\\}\">\\(\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j&lt;x+c\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff\\exists e,c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq x+c\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,Y,x,s,X(x),Q).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff\\exists e,c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq x+c\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,Y,x,s,X(x),Q).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land Y\\le_{\\rm sw}X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\equiv_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land Y\\le_{\\rm sw}X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>停机运行见证同时给出输出与全部查询位置，因而不对发散程序调用仅在停机域上定义的使用量。查询集合包含于x+c等价于原有上界加1的使用量至多x+c；程序仍只需在Y上总停机。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Definition 13.5.2；印刷页352，PDF页372。来源定位沿用附件；本轮复核形式化与内部依赖，未重新核对原书证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{Exec}$ 为 [[43-df-oracle-computation]] 的首次停机运行谓词。位编号从0起；对 $x,c\\in\\mathbb N$，有限序数 $x+c$ 表示查询位置集合 $\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<x+c\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Exec}","display":false},{"tex":"x,c\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"x+c","display":false},{"tex":"\\{j\\in\\mathbb N:j<x+c\\}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff\\exists e,c\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists Q\\subseteq x+c\\;\\operatorname{Exec}(e,Y,x,s,X(x),Q).","display":true},{"tex":"X\\equiv_{\\rm sw}Y\\iff X\\le_{\\rm sw}Y\\land Y\\le_{\\rm sw}X.","display":true}],"bytes":1581,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-326","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-sw-red]] — 常数附加使用的强弱真值表归约"},{"id":"c5ed5575b30a3867","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\le_{\\rm sw}$、$\\le_C$、$\\le_K$ 见 [[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-complexity-red]]。"},{"id":"3f502a94c920bde8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(B)$；$\\alpha_A,\\alpha_B\\in[0,1]$ 由下式定义。$A,B$ 的特征序列分别作sw的输入，$\\le_S$ 的输入为所列实数；相关定义见 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]。"},{"id":"5b05063e6c15465b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_S$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-solovay-red]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]。$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义；实数上的sw比较在下式直接使用给出的展开序列，避免隐藏选择。"},{"id":"b8bf0d96cd8e0489","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LeftComputable}$、$\\le_{\\rm sw}$ 见 [[43-df-leftcomputable]]、[[43-df-sw-red]]；$v:2^\\omega\\to[0,1]$ 由下式定义。下式所有sw比较均直接作用于给出的展开序列。"}],"outgoing":["4400f4836786a4bd"]}